00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.500
- Yeah, sure.
- Yes.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.340
- Like, talk about something
the world desperately needs.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.520
We wanna blame the algorithm,
we wanna blame our parents,

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.080
we wanna blame the government,

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.050
we wanna blame everything.
- [Kris] Yep.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.080
- We have become addicted
with pointing fingers

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.720
and nobody wants to point
the thumb at themselves.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.890
I believe most people's unhappiness

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.210
that are listening right now,

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.990
