their lack of accountability.

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:40.310
If you are unhappy,

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.600
you are actually in a position to fix it.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.850
If you are listening to this,

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.120
if you are listening to this,

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.200
you were of the means to fix it.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.140
And I think that accountability

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.680
is the breakthrough of the next decade,

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:57.483
because we've gotten very cozy
