00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.470
You have 23 year olds

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.540
who think that they don't
have their life figured out,

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.990
yet they're living for another 80 years.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.990
Patience has been huge for me.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.220
Most people hear the word patience

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.600
and have it confused with complacency,

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.770
laziness, lack of ambition,

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:23.603
it's not true.

00:07:23.603 --> 00:07:24.820
I actually think patience

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.140
has been foundational in my success.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.370
I decided to build my
dad's business for him

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.270
for the first 12 years of my career.

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:33.270
That required huge patience

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.080
from somebody who thought they were great.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:38.420
I didn't even start
quote-unquote until I was 34.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:40.270
Patience is huge, it's huge.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.290
And people don't wanna do it

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.920
'cause they want instant gratification.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:46.103
And more importantly,
instant outside validation.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:47.883
- [Kris] I like it.

